			"notes": "Fixes\n- [Package Shelves can be duplicated](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/24)\n- [Fluid packagers do not use Fluid fill/drain correctly](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/23)\n- [Battery charger creates empty batteries](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/22)\n- [Package Shelves crash when wrenched](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/15)\n- [Bottles & Batteries voiding on saws and when right-clicked](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/7)\n- [Rare bottles are missing models and translation key](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/21)\n- [Missing Packager Connector recipe](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/25)\n- [Battery Charger model has Z-fighting](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/29)\n- [Gauges do not send energy ingredient for recipes](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/41)\n- [Alt+scroll does not work in the recipe menu for energy gauges](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/42)\n- [Bottles and batteries can't be turned into Package Couriers planes](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/44)\n- [Packager Connectors and Battery Chargers voided contents when the target could not accept them](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/18)\n- Promise icon and amount of fluid and energy gauges (energy promises showed mB)\n\nFeatures\n- [Create Stock Bridge: fluids and energy (with Applied Flux) stored in AE2 can be ordered through a fluid packager or battery charger placed against the bridge](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/19)\n- [Battery Chargers accept energy from outside into an internal buffer, so they work with Create: Power Grid's Device Connector](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/43)\n- [Configurable bottle jar capacity](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Repackaged/issues/16)\n- Batteries will now spawn a lightning when opened if they contain more than 100.000⚡ (configurable)\n- ValueEditBox implementation\n- Fluid gauges default to 100 mB per connection and scroll in steps; the fluid tab shows amounts in its tooltips\n- Packagers hand packages to Packager Connectors before Frogports\n- Bottles and batteries are tagged as `create:packages`, so mods that accept any package accept them too\n- New Chinese (simplified), Russian, Japanese and German localisation\n\nCompatibility\n- Create Factory Logistics is marked as incompatible: Deployer and Extra Gauges now work with it, Repackaged does not yet (support is planned, see [fl.md](https://github.com/LIUKRAST/Deployer/blob/master/fl.md))\n- Built against compat_manager 1.0.9, so the Create Stock Bridge mixins load only when that mod is installed\n- Requires Deployer 1.0.0\n\nOther changes\n- The `fluid_gauge_clear` and `energy_gauge_clear` recipes moved from the `minecraft` to the `repackaged` namespace (datapacks overriding them need the new id)"
		},
